#: title/pc5_web_page.html:49
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem with PC5"
msgstr "Rapportér et problem med PC5"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:52
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Send a game"
msgstr "Send et spil"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:53
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Choose a game's folder: it goes to PC5's INSTALL folder, then PC5 asks to "
"install it."
msgstr ""
"Vælg et spils mappe: Den kommer i PC5's INSTALL-mappe, og så spørger PC5, "
"om det skal installeres."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:55
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose a folder"
msgstr "Vælg en mappe"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:57
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"A phone that can't choose a folder: type the game's folder name, then "
"choose its files."
msgstr ""
"En telefon, der ikke kan vælge en mappe: Skriv navnet på spillets mappe, "
"og vælg så dets filer."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:60
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose files"
msgstr "Vælg filer"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:66
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Games"
msgstr "Spil"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:66
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Opdater"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:68 title/pc5_web_page.html:74
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "Indlæser…"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:71
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Logs"
msgstr "Logfiler"

#. Web page text.
#. Keep <b>...</b> and <code>...</code> around the same words.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:72
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Attach one to an issue on GitHub when a game has a problem: a game's "
"<b>Report a problem</b> above downloads its newest log and opens GitHub's "
"form with the game, PC5 and its settings filled in."
msgstr ""
"Vedhæft en til et issue på GitHub, når et spil har et problem: Et spils "
"<b>Rapportér et problem</b> ovenfor downloader dets nyeste logfil og åbner "
"GitHubs formular med spillet, PC5 og dets indstillinger udfyldt."

#. Web page text.
#. A text box's hint, shown in it while it is empty.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:59
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The game's folder name"
msgstr "Navnet på spillets mappe"

