#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:146
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Saved: its cover, background and details are fetched again when PC5 opens."
msgstr "Gemt: Dets omslag, baggrund og detaljer hentes igen, når PC5 åbner."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:147
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Cleared: PC5 reads the game's folder again."
msgstr "Ryddet: PC5 læser spillets mappe igen."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:149 title/pc5_web_page.html:174
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not saved: %s"
msgstr "Ikke gemt: %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:152
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "; GOG product %s"
msgstr "; GOG-produkt %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:153
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"PC5 picks the game's cover, background and details by this number (%s%s). "
"If they are another game's, type the number from the game's Steam store "
"link (store.steampowered.com/app/<number>). Empty: PC5 reads the folder "
"again."
msgstr ""
"PC5 vælger spillets omslag, baggrund og detaljer ud fra dette nummer "
"(%s%s). Hvis de hører til et andet spil, så skriv nummeret fra spillets "
"link i Steam-butikken (store.steampowered.com/app/<nummer>). Tomt: PC5 "
"læser mappen igen."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:172
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved: used at the game's next start."
msgstr "Gemt: bruges ved spillets næste start."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:187
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "Ingen spil endnu."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:190
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "USB-drev"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:191
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "kan ikke starte"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "Indstillinger: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:199
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "Nyeste logfil"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:201
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Rapportér et problem"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:202
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr ""
"Downloader den nyeste logfil og åbner GitHubs formular udfyldt: Vedhæft "
"logfilen der."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:208
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "Startindstillinger (launch.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:209
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr ""
"Den første linje, der ikke er tom eller en kommentar (# eller ;), føjes "
"til programmets kommandolinje."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:212
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "Miljøvariabler (env.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:212
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "Én NAVN=værdi pr. linje, sat før spillet starter."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:213
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "Ekstra logning (winedebug.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:214
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr ""
"Kun når et issue beder om det, for eksempel err+all,+seh. Tøm den "
"bagefter: Den gør spillet langsommere."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
